# The libnftnl library nft links: 1.3.2 from netfilter.org, the newest release on 2026-11-13. Its
# digest is the tarball's line in the .sha256sum file netfilter.org publishes beside it, under
# https://www.netfilter.org/pub/libnftnl/. The version and the digest move together, in one pull
# request, which a reviewer checks against that file.
#
# Moved by: the PM, in a pull request that reruns `make image` and `make image-repro` and the QEMU
# tests of a host's networks, when an advisory is published for the pinned one. No bot proposes it.
LIBNFTNL_VERSION=1.3.2
LIBNFTNL_URL=https://www.netfilter.org/pub/libnftnl/libnftnl-1.3.2.tar.xz
LIBNFTNL_SHA256=c97abc3409f8fa396b4462b2bb7f147a3a47a4ddc97cfa0b2f18890c9cfde8b0
#
# Licences (SPDX), read from the COPYING or LICENSE of each source and checked by naru-release (ADR 0076).
LIBNFTNL_LICENSE=GPL-2.0-or-later
